# impeller/

Scaffolded by `npx react-native init-impeller` for **{{displayName}}**.

- `impeller.config.json` — window + app identity. The app name registered by the
  engine is `{{appName}}`, taken from your `app.json`; the engine runs the same
  name it registers.
- `build/` — Metro output for `--platform impeller`. Safe to delete; regenerated
  by `run-impeller`. Add it to `.gitignore`.

The engine binary is **not** here. It is installed from npm as
`@react-native-impeller/engine-<platform>-<arch>` (an optional dependency of
`react-native-impeller`) and located at runtime by the resolver. Set
`IMPELLER_ENGINE_BINARY` to point at a locally built engine instead.

Run it:

    npx react-native run-impeller
